mediate or resolve any disputes or disagreements between the Customer/Buyer/User and the Seller and both Seller and Customer/Buyer/User shall settle all such disputes without involving Magicbricks Realty Services Limited in any manner.\n\nAll trademarks, logos and names are properties of their respective owners. All Rights Reserved. © Copyright 2026 Magicbricks Realty Services Limited.","images":[]},{"url":"https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/lodha-malabar-project-walkeshwar-mumbai/1245","title":"Lodha Malabar Walkeshwar | Latest Price, Floor Plans & Brochure","raw_content":"[![keystonerealestateadvisory.com](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/gallery/ks-logo.webp)](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com)\n\nAll Categories\n\n* All Categories\n* Shops\n* Hotels\n* Restaurants\n* Bars\n* Events\n* Fitness\n\n\n\n1. [Home](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com)\n2. [Mumbai](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/flats-for-sale-in-mumbai)\n3. [South Mumbai](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/flats-for-sale-in-south-mumbai-mumbai)\n4. [walkeshwar](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/flats-for-sale-in-walkeshwar-mumbai)\n5. Lodha Malabar\n\n[![Lodha Malabar Project Images 1](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/t8d64ojKsI5Q5XDckoKg28UQ0tc6dwPvf0HsTZlI.webp)](#)\n\n\n\n## About Lodha Malabar\n\n### Overview\n\n![Project Area](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/network.svg) Project Area\n\n![ Number of Storey's](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/building.svg) No. of Storey's\n\n6.2 Acres\n\nG+31 Storeys\n\n![Possession Date](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/calendar.svg) Possession Date\n\n![Possession Status](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/construction.svg) Possession Status\n\n![ Number of Storey's](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/building.svg) Project Rera No.\n\nJune 2027\n\nUnder Construction\n\n---\n\n### Introduction\n\n**Planning to buy a property in Lodha Malabar walkeshwar, Mumbai? Check out these details below**\n\nLodha Malabar is a new launch luxury residential project in walkeshwar, Mumbai. JP INFRA offers luxury 4BHK and 5BHK flats in Mumbai for sale, featuring lifetime access to a golf club.\n\n**Lodha Malabar Connectivity**  \n Located in walkeshwar, Mumbai. Lodha Malabar is situated in a well-established area. The location is in proximity to:\n\n* Sir H. N. Reliance Foundation Hospital\n* Edubridge International School\n* Heera Panna Shopping Center\n* Eastern Express Hwy, Nagpada\n* University Of Mumbai\n* Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj Intl Airport\n\n**Project Details of Lodha Malabar Mumbai**  \n The Lodha Malabar Project, developed by JP INFRA, spans 6.2 acres and features 1 high-rise tower with G+31 floors.\n\n**Carpet Area**  \n Lodha Malabar is an Under Construction project by JP INFRA. in walkeshwar, Mumbai, offering 4BHK and 5BHK flats for sale. A perfect combination of inspiring architecture, high-end specifications, and connectivity with major expressways are added advantages for comfortable living. The carpet areas of these Mumbai flats are\n\n* 4 BHK - 3826-4036 Sq.ft\n* 5 BHK - 6271-6640 Sq.ft\n\n**Amenities**  \n Lodha Malabar Mumbai by JP INFRA offers 10+ lifestyle amenities, such as -\n\n* Gym\n* Club house\n* Kids Play Area\n* Banquet Hall\n\n**Rera & Possession Timeline**  \n JP INFRA New Launch Lodha Malabar Rera Number is P51900034949, and the Rera Possession is in June 2027.\n\n**Why invest in JP INFRA Mumbai property?**\n\n* Well-established Location\n* Upgraded Lifestyle\n* Good Safety & Security\n* Easy Access to Basic Facilities\n\nTo get the reviews of JP INFRA, or to schedule a visit to the Lodha Malabar walkeshwar, Mumbai Project sample flat, call us today!\n\n[Read More](javascript:void(0);) [Read Less](javascript:void(0);)\n\n---\n\n### Download Brochure\n\nReceive a digital copy of   \nLodha Malabar brochure\n\n## Pricing of Lodha Malabar\n\n### Pricing & Unit Plans\n\n* [4 BHK Apartment](#tabs-9)\n* [5 BHK Apartment](#tabs-11)\n\n* [3826 sqft](#tabs-5288)\n* [4036 sqft](#tabs-5289)\n\n![4 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n4 BHK | Carpet Area: 3826 sqft | Price:\n\n![4 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n4 BHK | Carpet Area: 4036 sqft | Price:\n\n* [6271 sqft](#tabs-5290)\n* [6640 sqft](#tabs-5291)\n\n![5 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n5 BHK | Carpet Area: 6271 sqft | Price:\n\n![5 BHK  Unit Plan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/layout.webp) \n\n5 BHK | Carpet Area: 6640 sqft | Price:\n\n## Property Features of Lodha Malabar\n\n### Amenities\n\n* ![Banquet Hall](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/nVnv7aXBAjY7xGCOJG6gfa3JfUAOKFn4ktPtHEG8.webp) Banquet Hall\n\n* ![Club house](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/XHmlGOsa5pmWAop1jsrzbhwfyh0ZziFBsDDydKHm.webp) Club house\n\n* ![Sports Courts](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/nbOC3ahgBFfPoXp1KsSLitr2C30r6v4wsl5bP6X8.webp) Sports Courts\n\n* ![Kids Play Area](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/caC1nd4EG3aPxrSHSy42KOuI69993uXqnhmO5wM1.webp) Kids Play Area\n\n* ![Swimming Pool](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/SFZjCUNkC7Mx0X3VU5OrVgx4mtJUvqfykBy0PZer.webp) Swimming Pool\n\n* ![Yoga Zone](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/COwM5RjENyf7U7nEW3taZHaXwLNwUKHFpeE88skI.webp) Yoga Zone\n\n* ![Gym](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/IGXHlscIm9ZRf5Dwqaa7fOuHpxoQXC8VN6qHvSos.webp) Gym\n\n---\n\n### Facilities\n\n* ![Intercom](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/CBrT8D2Yj9H3yZtjvMxDM3OAtAQg0yw7lKqZpr8h.webp) Intercom\n\n* ![Lift](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/PlsX6Ye4mz30wZTyU2HUzRfZZAF1UyAfAPcv7UW6.webp) Lift\n\n* ![Power Back Up](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/hyhD5ZsEryAKGW3ZBDuJfwfIbR00KY59KGRA3TdM.webp) Power Back Up\n\n* ![Parking](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/Mn1Br3z95nMIVacp1Oa7MFHiuII6ZjpgFaetLKCL.webp) Parking\n\n* ![Security System](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/6dsfc7xPvlsYjnrmZXSMQCe0h9jTiIuqmb3G3wvM.webp) Security System\n\n* ![Natural Light](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/mNkl8OtoW2yEeCwJs9CyZS4pA6w786UsJLRZYH2z.webp) Natural Light\n\n* ![Airy Rooms](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/T45jLRY6wMGBiz3hvUPuSsYeNtObK7CQdWXudLRh.webp) Airy Rooms\n\n* ![24*7 Water](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/amenity/8r8bjKftbO1sSY8rBawv8AexZBpGB5Yes5BaCx4g.png) 24\\*7 Water\n\n## Bank Offers\n\n![About Keystone Real Estate Advisory](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/ks/images/home-loan-banner.webp)  [Contact Us Now](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/contact)\n\n![Aditya Birla Capital](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/XGrM42hFHDybp1Y19862M4OyJ8gDOsg3EE9GTEB1.webp) 8.00% - 13.00%\n\n![Axis Bank Home Loan](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/QZdtxvhynBtBOc30oXZBnWVc5XQBY2AurKebGOt2.webp) 7.60% - 8.05%\n\n![Bajaj Finserv](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/AXQcBE3UdCXzDqCrUfdYix4bnsRarkLpNFpY10H8.webp) 7.70% - 14.00%\n\n![Bank of Baroda](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/6MLWA1aTbSguKjxxqZVVnPer7FyazH85YXJv5wKD.webp) 7.45% - 8.80%\n\n![Citi Bank](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/LHciFR3ExZu3X7BihADb9fpp2Z3Di0ilFvyjptMj.webp) 6.50% - 7.40%\n\n![HDFC Home Loans](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/k3SCEAb5zwzavNb1Y4gZHIIQ3BcUHxpxXR91uXrP.webp) 8.60% - 9.50%\n\n![ICICI Bank](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/dqWrCKj6YqYmSpdnc40KNaPQPIv9Bf22dDHhDJiq.webp) 8.40% - 9.45%\n\n![LIC Housing Finanace](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/ka0moGXIt4v3z8y16KQ8ruJG3F4rd40bQOManwKw.webp) 8.00% - 9.25%\n\n![PNB Housing](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/6qI41xrrVMUFAEQxiGmSUiVbE48cfvqF8GTHp9CE.webp) 8.25% - 11.20%\n\n![SBI Home Loans](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/banklogos/6LuvpQu1AjCfFOMusgBFDVfK8REKUqT5rwwi9psG.webp) 8.05%-8.55%\n\n## Location of Lodha Malabar\n\n### Google Map\n\n---\n\n### Location AV\n\nExperience location of Lodha Malabar from the comfort of your home\n\n---\n\n### About walkeshwar\n\nA prestigious and historic South Mumbai locality, Walkeshwar is home to the Governor’s residence (Raj Bhavan) and several ancient temples. Highlights include the Banganga Tank, a holy water body surrounded by old temples and monasteries, and the stunning views of the Arabian Sea. It is a quiet, leafy enclave that offers a unique mix of spiritual heritage and high-end residential living at the southern tip of the Malabar Hill.\n\n**Walkeshwar Location Offers Proximity To:**\n\n* Charni Road\n* Grant Road\n* Maheshwari Devi Temple\n* Marine Lines Railway station\n* Mumbai Central\n* Malbar Hill Police Station Bus Stop\n\n**Popular Landmarks in Walkeshwar**\n\n* Sardar Pav Bhaji\n* Haji Ali Juice Centre\n* Shalimar Restaurant\n* Sukh Sagar\n* Pizza By The Bay\n\n**Schools and Colleges in Walkeshwar**\n\n* Walsingham House School\n* Gopi Birla Memorial School\n* ORCHIDS The International School - CBSE School in Masjid Bunder\n* Aditya Birla World Academy\n* Bhavans College\n\n**Hospitals in Walkeshwar**\n\n* Narayana Health SRCC Children's Hospital, Mumbai\n* Wockhardt Hospitals, Mumbai Central\n* Dr. Manish S Shah Clinic | Unit of Dr Agarwals Eye Hospital\n\n**Shopping and Entertainment in Walkeshwar**\n\n* CR2 Shopping Mall\n* Sumitra Market\n* City Centre Mumbai\n* Rubberwala The Platinum Mall\n\n## About Lodha Group\n\n![Lodha Group](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/developer/nZtsHoi2qQf6OmzYZz6eOplTaTtYJWeqxmkzd7HT.jpg)\n\n* Year Estd. 1980\n* [Projects - 124](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/lodha-group-projects-in-mumbai)\n\n#### Lodha Group\n\nLodha Group is a pre-eminent Indian real estate developer renowned for its luxurious residential and commercial projects. Originating in 1980 under the visionary leadersh\n\nread more\n\nip of Mangal Prabhat Lodha, the company has evolved into a multinational conglomerate with a substantial footprint across India's major metropolitan areas and London. Synonymous with opulence and quality, Lodha has redefined the luxury living experience with iconic projects like Lodha Altamount and The World Towers. Beyond luxury, the group's portfolio encompasses a diverse range of properties, catering to various market segments. Their commitment to innovation is exemplified in large-scale integrated townships like Palava, which offer residents a holistic lifestyle. Backed by a strong financial foundation and a steadfast dedication to customer satisfaction, Lodha Group has solidified its position as a dominant force in India's real estate landscape.\n\nread less\n\n## QR Codes of Lodha Malabar\n\n![P51900034949.webp](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/5zUsq8zHiJadrkzqfUSw3b0XyOTyF1HRjvNJ28k6.webp) P51900034949\n\n## EMI Calculator\n\n₹1,00,00,000 ₹2,00,00,000 ₹3,00,00,000\n\n###### Monthly EMI: ₹0.00\n\n## FAQ's of Lodha Malabar\n\nWhat is the address of Lodha Malabar?\n\nThe Lodha Malabar is located at Walkeshwar, Malabar Hill, Mumbai.  [Book Site Visit Here](#myModal)\n\nWhat is Rera Number of Lodha Malabar?\n\nLodha Malabar Walkeshwar RERA number is P51900034949.\n\nWhat configurations are available at Lodha Malabar Walkeshwar?\n\nLodha Malabar offers premium 4,5 BHK Apartment flats for sale in Walkeshwar.\n\nWhat is the starting price of a flat at Lodha Malabar Walkeshwar?\n\nLodha Malabar flat price in Walkeshwar starts at ₹ Onwards.\n\n...\n\nHow many floors are there in the Lodha Malabar Walkeshwar project?\n\nThe Lodha Malabar Walkeshwar project boasts G+31 storeys offering well-planned layouts and modern amenities.\n\nWhat is the Possession Date of Lodha Malabar Walkeshwar?\n\nThe project is Under Construction   \n The Lodha Malabar Walkeshwar RERA possession is scheduled for June 2027.\n\nWhy choose the Lodha Malabar residential project in Walkeshwar?\n\nLodha Malabar is one of the best  [residential projects in Walkeshwar](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/residential-property-for-sale-in-walkeshwar-mumbai) for both investment and living purposes. Get access to the best of schools, hospitals, and entertainment hubs.  [Express your interest today](#myModal)\n\nFrom where to get the floor plan of Lodha Malabar Walkeshwar?\n\nThe Lodha Malabar Walkeshwar floor plan is designed for optimum use and plenty of natural light. The layouts are designed as per Vastu principles.  [Check out the floor plan here.](#myModal)\n\nFrom where to get the price sheet of Lodha Malabar Walkeshwar?\n\nThe Lodha Malabar Walkeshwar price sheet is important for clarity on the price breakdown and other payment details of the flat.  [Check price sheet](#myModal)\n\nWhat are the stamp duty and registration charges in Walkeshwar’s Lodha Malabar project?\n\nThe stamp duty and registration charges in Walkeshwar for Lodha Malabar may vary depending on current government regulations. For the latest update connect with our sales team. [Call Now](tel:7045670457)\n\nWhat kind of amenities are available at Lodha Malabar Walkeshwar?\n\nThe Lodha Malabar project in Walkeshwar offers a wide range of lifestyle amenities, including a swimming pool, jogging track, gym, kids play area, multipurpose lawn, garden, senior citizen zone, and more.\n\nHow is the connectivity near Lodha Malabar Walkeshwar?\n\nStrategically located on in Walkeshwar, Lodha Malabar enjoys exceptional connectivity via roads, highways, and railways. The upcoming infrastructure makes it easier for daily travelers.\n\n## More Projects near Walkeshwar\n\n[![Navyug Bafna Prid](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/BoWeAd11OrP64kMmvYIHAATBotjJJSOr8UqL9EVK.webp)\n\nRead more](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/navyug-bafna-prid-project-walkeshwar-mumbai/1408) \n\n### [Navyug Bafna Prid](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/navyug-bafna-prid-project-walkeshwar-mumbai/1408)\n\n##### by Bafna Metstrips Private Limited\n\n1,2,3 BHK Apartment  \n walkeshwar, Mumbai\n\n₹ 1.64 Cr - 5.26 Cr\n\n[![Lodha Malabar](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/t8d64ojKsI5Q5XDckoKg28UQ0tc6dwPvf0HsTZlI.webp)\n\nRead more](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/lodha-malabar-project-walkeshwar-mumbai/1245) \n\n### [Lodha Malabar](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/lodha-malabar-project-walkeshwar-mumbai/1245)\n\n##### by Lodha Group\n\n4,5 BHK Apartment  \n walkeshwar, Mumbai\n\n[![Aurum Seven](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/24ob8dp6K9gHc6W7cEXX2ALzuzTEUPgWZyY15zmd.webp)\n\nRead more](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/aurum-seven-project-walkeshwar-mumbai/1171) \n\n### [Aurum Seven](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/aurum-seven-project-walkeshwar-mumbai/1171)\n\n##### by Aurum Real Estate Developers Limited\n\n3,4 BHK Apartment  \n walkeshwar, Mumbai\n\n₹ 46.00 Cr - 65.00 Cr\n\n## More Projects by Lodha Group\n\n[![Lodha Sovrano](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/property/avMmQqnLKJejBd13NE2z99NXex37LU6hb41UOm8h.webp)\n\nRead more](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/lodha-sovrano-project-jogeshwari-west-mumbai/8841) \n\n### [Lodha Sovrano](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/new/lodha-sovrano-project-jogeshwari-west-