m/assets/images/header/post-property.png)\n![](https://www.truehomes24.com/assets/images/header/post-property-per-day.png)\n![](https://www.truehomes24.com/assets/images/header/post-property-per-day.png)\n![](https://www.truehomes24.com/assets/images/header/post-property-per-day.png)\n![](https://www.truehomes24.com/assets/images/header/pay.jpg)\n![](https://www.truehomes24.com/assets/images/header/pay.jpg)\n![](https://www.truehomes24.com/assets/images/header/pay.jpg)\n![](https://www.truehomes24.com/assets/properties/banner-02/aefb0add3b3d25bc1ea58894bdf78273.webp)\n\nConfigurations\n\nPossession By\n\n(Super Builtup Area)\n\n# 5 BHK Apartment for Sale in Lodha Malabar, Malabar Hill , Mumbai For Sale Apartment Property ID : 1000- 45463\n\n**Society:** \nLodha Malabar Malabar Hill Mumbai,\nMaharashtra,\nIndia\n\n![Lodha Group](https://www.truehomes24.com/assets/dynamic/user_profile_photo/78c895666e21fc84f615ea7835210aef.jpg)\n\n#### Property Details\n\n#### Amenities\n\n#### Property Brief\n\nLodha Malabar Residential projects in Mumbai offering Apartments for sale in Malabar Hill. The property offers 4&5BHK Apartments meticulously planned that guarantee a hassle-free lifestyle. As per the area plan it has 36 units in the size range 3843.00 sq.ft. - 11643.00 sq.ft. Possession date is June 2026. Lodha Malabar offers prices suitable for both luxurious and affordable Apartments in Mumbai. Lodha Malabar is located Malabar Hill. This is considered as best Apartments for sale in Mumbai and best Apartments for sale in Malabar Hill.\n\nThe floor plan of Lodha Malabar enables the best utilization of the space with spacious balconies, standard kitchen size and high-quality fixtures. Location advantage of Lodha Malabar is its proximity to Reputed Schools and Colleges. Unmatched connectivity from all the important landmarks and places. Easy access to everyday utility such as hospitals, schools, supermarts, parks, recreational centers etc.\n\nIn terms of facilities, Lodha Malabar is loaded with multiple offerings such as Gymnasium, Power Backup. For families with kids, there is Children Play Area. It is a Gated Community. Immerse yourself in a world of sports with provisions for Tennis Court, Basketball court, Badminton Court, Cycling. Residents can make use of Restaurants/Cafeterias, Internet / Wi-Fi, provisions in the project. There is 24x7 Security. It is one of the most admired properties for sale in Mumbai and admired properties for sale in Malabar Hill.\n\n#### Map Location\n\n#### About Lodha Group Builder\n\nAt Lodha, our passion is to create landmarks that meet global standards, epitomise the values of our family, and are built on a legacy of trust spanning four decades. We are guided by our vision of ‘Building a Better Life’ and believe that homes transform lives. A home is a springboard for the dreams and aspirations, for living a healthier and fulfilled life.\n\nEvery one of our developments delivers the highest level of design and craftsmanship, uncompromising quality, unparalleled service – putting Lodha developments in the league of the world’s finest. Our homes are ensconced in developments where we bring alive multitude of experiences – all geared to help one live their best life. Be it the carefully crafted vast open spaces, the manicured greens, the world-class gyms, the sports arenas to even the places of worship among other things, are built to enrich lives.\n\nWe have the experience and skills to deliver both quality and scale, at a pace which is unmatched in the country. By forging the finest global partnerships, and deploying the best people and processes, we are able to create the best value for our customers across geographies, markets, price points and consumer segments. We have been able to create landmark developments across residential, retail & office spaces, winning the trust and appreciation of our patrons time and again.\n\nMost importantly, as an organization which makes probably the longest-term impact: to our environment, urban fabric and the lives of those who live and work in our development, we are committed to act in the larger interest of the environment and society. We are ‘building a better life’ in more ways than we imagined.\n\n#### Gallery\n\n![slide](https://www.truehomes24.com/assets/properties/gallery-03/b0c8cf887f99d55be0dd9371c34fa255.webp)\n\n#### What's Nearby?\n\n#### Hospital : 2\n\n#### ATM : 1\n\n#### School : 2\n\n#### Bank : 2\n\n#### Restaurant : 1\n\n#### Spa Beauty Salon : 2\n\n#### Frequently Asked Questions(FAQ)\n\n#### [What is the price range of Lodha Malabar ?](#collapseOne)\n\n#### [Is Lodha Malabar RERA Registered? If Yes, What is the RERA Registration No of Lodha Malabar?](#collapseTwo)\n\n#### [What is the size or area range of Lodha Malabar?](#collapseThree)\n\n#### [Where is Lodha Malabar located?](#collapseFour)\n\n#### [What is the construction status of Lodha Malabar?](#collapseFive)\n\n#### [What is the possession date of Lodha Malabar?](#collapseSix)\n\n### Featured Property\n\n![Apartment for Sale in Eldeco The Studio, Sector 93A, Noida](https://www.truehomes24.com/assets/properties/banner-01/fb5996ba015090da2707f646583879c2.webp)\n\n#### [Apartment for Sale in Eldeco The Studio, Sector 93A, Noida](https://www.truehomes24.com/sale/apartment-for-sale-in-eldeco-the-studio-sector-93a-noida/1000-38866)\n\nNoida, Uttar Pradesh, India\n\n41.95 L\n\n![Apartment for Sale in Manglam 14 Woodland Park, Mansarovar, Jaipur](https://www.truehomes24.com/assets/properties/banner-02/8b13652f7c7b04913bf3e1983a727409.webp)\n\n#### [Apartment for Sale in Manglam 14 Woodland Park, Mansarovar, Jaipur](https://www.truehomes24.com/sale/apartment-for-sale-in-manglam-14-woodland-park-mansarovar-jaipur/1000-63085)\n\nJaipur, Rajasthan, India\n\n2.22 Cr\n\n![Apartment for Sale in Adhithyaa Rangasri, Srirangam, Trichy](https://www.truehomes24.com/assets/properties/banner-02/0aeafb3facb34970210b4669bfc53fff.webp)\n\n#### [Apartment for Sale in Adhith